            {
              "_type": "callout",
              "type": "insight",
              "text": "Rakesh is the case where the old regime still wins, and only because his structure matches his life: HRA sized exactly at rent minus 10% of basic, children education allowance for two children, Section 123 exhausted, health insurance, and his own NPS. Take away the rent or the children and the new regime moves ahead.",
