            {
              "_type": "callout",
              "type": "warning",
              "text": "One trade-off Rakesh accepted: employer NPS is capped at 10% of basic in the old regime, against 14% in the new. He gives up deduction on ₹56,000 of possible employer NPS (₹1,96,000 minus ₹1,40,000) to keep his HRA and education allowance exemptions.",
